# kerpo-skills — GitHub content policy

Learned from repo history on 2026-08-19 by `kerpo-gh-content-policy-learn`,
re-confirmed unchanged on 2026-08-23. Canonical copy lives at
`.github/content-policy.md` — update that file first, then re-run the skill
to resync this one.

## Evidence sampled

- All PRs (`gh pr list --state merged`): 1 total — a bot-generated Renovate
  onboarding PR (#3, merged via `Merge pull request #3`). No human-authored
  PR exists yet in this repo.
- All issues (`gh issue list --state all`): 3 total — 2 closed (`#1`, `#2`,
  both by @jounirajala), 1 open (`#4`, Renovate Dependency Dashboard,
  bot-generated).
- Commit history (`git log`): only one `Merge pull request` commit (the
  Renovate onboarding PR above) — all other work lands via direct commits to
